{"c":[{"name":"20261002T113723Z-0310b3f1df11a0ac","text":"KeyType tokenizes with add_special=false; Gemma GGUFs need <bos> or output derails. apps/caret wraps the runtime (BOSRuntime) instead of editing packages/.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T113723Z-250b757576dc3838","text":"Synthetic HID keys go to LaunchServices' front app, not the owner of the frontmost window; guard on lsappinfo front before typing into a fixture.","type":"note"}]}
